{"parse": {"title": "飞渡往日-06", "pageid": 55488, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-05\" title=\"飞渡往日-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">飞渡往日-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-07\" title=\"飞渡往日-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">飞渡往日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A4.A9.E7.A9.B9.E6.9C.89.E7.BF.BC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"天穹有翼\">天穹有翼</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 天穹有翼</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Inherited Wings</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1960106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">职员：</div><div>露西女士，很感谢您两年来在航天中心的服务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">职员：</div><div>休假安排在相关文件上已经做了详细说明，接下来请享受您的假期。佛罗里达海岸的阳光向来颇受游人欢迎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士接过纸质通知。于她而言，只要电力供应充足，休假或是工作，其实并无不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">职员：</div><div>您可以在电视上观看月球登陆直播，直播时间请参考相关通知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>请致电湾岸中学外联办公室，胡安娜女士接。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>她这时候该在办公室的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">职员：</div><div>好、好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_dianhuatexie\"><img alt=\"at_dianhuatexie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/600px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/900px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/1200px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-513920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-513920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-513920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你好，胡安娜女士。我今天就到，最迟——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬眼看向挂钟，三根指针恰好连成直线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>最迟日落之前。嗯，待会儿见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-513920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-513920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-513920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>嗯，嗯，我在学校等你。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一向珍视时间，一向不愿为了琐事耽搁，将电话挂断得干净利落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我需要去湾岸镇的车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">职员：</div><div>好的。麻烦到基地第一公路旁的K-388车位等待，十五分钟后会有一趟专车在那儿等您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>要开多久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">职员：</div><div>路况良好的话，不超过一个小时车程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">职员：</div><div>请放心，军方已经在基地附近实行了交通管制，您将一路畅通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，好，很高兴看到航天中心保持着它一贯的高效作风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>预祝你们顺利，我十分期待看到登月舱抵达月球的历史性时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>噢，对了，还有我在卧室里的行李，那些储备电池和机械设备，全都需要装车带走。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuezoulang\"><img alt=\"daxuezoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/600px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/900px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/1200px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不擅长对付学生，因为这些少年少女的脑袋里总是装满天马行空的想法，难以理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士走进校园，人类后代便将她团团围住，好奇地上上下下摆弄她的金属身躯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/HeadIconSmall-616101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/HeadIconSmall-616101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/HeadIconSmall-616101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿，机器人！山姆、安妮，你们都来看看！哇喔！一个真正的机器人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>请让开——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>请——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人类少年的身高在他们蓬勃旺盛的好奇心面前显得那么小，却令她无处挪步，让她被困在走廊，没法动弹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>给客人让路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你们这样不礼貌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>噢，胡安娜。你看起来很健康，比从前更健康。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>这就是你打招呼的方式吗？哈哈，你好像从人们那儿学到了些东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>健康的身体和灵活的大脑有助于更好地推进手中的工作。我也会定期检修自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>确保性能良好，保证各部位装置妥善运行，以免在关键时刻丧失行动能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>好了，小飞行员们，你们一定很想去海边活动活动，把东西都搬过去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我和这位客人还有事情要谈，待会儿咱们再见。去吧，别在这里拦住大家的路。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>这些是奖杯，我的学生抱回来的。带这些青春期小孩可一点不比在航天中心的工作轻松。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>胡安娜女士颇为骄傲地将自己的成就指给昔日同事，这丝毫不逊色于她过去的成功。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>很高兴看到你有一份充实的退休生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>是吗？我反倒觉得能看到你像现在这样从茫茫多的事务里抽身出来休息，很让人高兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>妥善维护有益于延长设备的使用寿命喔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>只要供电稳定……噢，这里的电灯是接触不良吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灯管不时闪烁，从踏进校门那一刻起，机械女士就注意到这儿似乎在有意识地控制能耗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>或许是发电机出了故障，别紧张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>噢，不！你们应该……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>放松，露西，湾岸镇的人们已经习惯了这种生活，不会持续太久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>这附近的维护团队都被抽调到航天中心待命了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我不想错过后天早晨的直播，万一供电系统出了问题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>留点儿后手总是好事，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我同意。考虑到最糟糕的情况，这些应急预案当然有它们的价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但最好别让这些价值真正发挥功效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>……找到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>记得这个吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士摊开稿纸，这是胡安娜离开时她赠与的礼物——小小的、像人类一样代表着善意的礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这只是我参与过的众多项目之一，得益于近年来航空事业的进步，它的价值才被重新发现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>当时我很忙，它在你手里会比放在我的储物柜里更有作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>不，是你一直在完善它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我只是记录并保存着它们，偶尔做一些尝试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>更何况我已经起码两年没关注这件事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>进展如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>不比你们这几年发射的火箭慢，哈哈，但也没你想象中那么厉害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>没关系，这只是个时间问题。或快或慢，只是非常简单的时间投入与产出效率的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不过最近十年我们在航空航天领域的进步快得不可思议，各方都在加大投入，这是好事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>俄国研究人员在过去二十年的实践提供了很大帮助，他们已经验证了技术的可行性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>是呀……有人跑在前面，别的选手就会不甘心落后，于是奋起直追。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>拜科努尔发射场把第一颗卫星发射到了平流层外，所以我们也这么干。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>后来，竞争对手又把火箭抛上宇宙，于是我们也不甘心，在佛罗里达研究中心紧跟着搞了自己的火箭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>他们还想把手伸向月球、伸向火星和更远的天外星海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>但我们不会跟在他们屁股后面吃火箭尾焰了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的笑容中似乎张扬着一种信心，一种对于竞胜争先的渴望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我很欣赏这种竞争意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>和对手一起跑，往往能让我们跑得更快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>如果后天下午他们能把人类的脚印落在月球上，胡安娜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>那接下来就会有更多——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>新的足迹，新的探测器，新的宇航员，然后是小型定居点，第一批移民……航天中心已经有相关规划了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>置身事外的女士似乎对此并不关心，而是回望着展示柜——那是她的学生得到的荣耀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>是啊，山姆和彼得也常常为谁的小飞机飞得更高、更久而较劲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>这些奖杯里有一半是山姆的，而另一半则属于彼得。少了任何一个，他们中的另一个就会变得倦怠，躺在过去的荣誉上懒洋洋地发呆，停步不前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两个少年奋力争先，都渴望着摘下下一个哪怕是小得好似芥菜种子般的胜利，将之装扮上先前斩获的桂冠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，所以呢？你的学生们有些什么成果？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>他们向往飞行，所以我拿着你给的设计，跟他们一起折腾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>你提供的原型机对我们很有帮助，那比半个世纪前的飞行翼雏形改良了不少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是吗？它几乎一直都被搁置着，胡安娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我没有特别对它们做什么，当曾经卡住研究的麻烦取得新的突破时，我就做一点改进，然后试试看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这种实验品很少能达到预期效果，但总归在慢慢向前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>你没有放弃它们，露西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>没有任何项目该被草率放弃，除非它们已被确证毫无价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但这种情况不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>准确来说，这种情况极少，极少极少，从概率层面几乎可以忽略。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>而问题在于时间、资源和有限的精力，我没办法维护所有东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>只要记得它们，不要忘掉就好，未来总有人会再捡起那些被搁置的幻想——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>来吧，露西，去看看你播下的小小的种子们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i><span style=\"font-size:116%\">一个无心之举。</span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>两年过去，它已经萌芽、茁壮，开出小小的花蕾了。但那只是个业余项目，没什么商业价值，是孩子们的玩具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我不记得在这里进行过植物培植相关的研究。也许是我忘了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>有什么种子需要种下去，还得再等两年时间才会开始生长？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>或许你们该检查一下温室环境的各项参数，比如保温和透光性能。需要我帮忙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>几颗种在孩子们心里的，被写在纸上、曾被它们短视的主人抛弃的种子。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>哈哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>跟我去看看吧！佛罗里达的雏鸟们都很想飞得更高些呢——</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "飞渡往日-06"}}